            </Box>

            {/* 右：两套口径 + 性能 */}
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                        桩模式　十二组 109 条，未通过 0 条
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontFamily: '微软雅黑', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        验证链路完整性：节点是否都走到、断言是否都能过。它不证明模型能力，advanced 组因桩实现不支持而整体跳过。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', border: { left: { width: 4, color: '#1E4FA8' } }, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                        真实模型　主链路 10 / 10
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontFamily: '微软雅黑', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        qwen-plus 端到端跑通；初版 8/10，两条失败为口径漂移，补入口径签名校验后复跑 10/10。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', border: { left: { width: 4, color: '#3D7BD9' } }, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
